The Legacy 8B-era demos section is now stale: prior agent re-ran all six
on qb1 against the current TT-NN install on 2026-05-21 and pushed the
results to REPRODUCE.md (commit d14a547). README still claimed they had
not been re-run from qb1/qb2 and were kept for historical reference only.

Replace that section with a re-verified table mirroring REPRODUCE.md
numbers, drop the old vs new filename alias table (REPRODUCE.md now uses
the actual filenames so there is no alias to document).

Also validated as part of this commit: anonymous git clone of the public
repo on qb1 + the README setup steps 3+4 (uv sync then
uv pip install -e TT_METAL_HOME --no-build-isolation) end with a working
ttnn import in .venv/, and a fresh-clone experiments.serve.client
generate talks cleanly to the prod server.py socket and decodes 16
tokens at 5.12 tok/s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
